Package: saferMake
Type: Package
Title: Shiny app to convert a R function to a safer-r function
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-09-22
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Gael", family = "Millot",  email = "gael.millot@pasteur.fr", role = c("cre", "aut", "ctb"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0591-3509"))
  )
Encoding: UTF-8
Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: Shiny app, launched by make(), that converts a user R function into a function written according to the safer-r project recommendations for R function development (see <https://github.com/safer-r>), and test() function that runs the safer-r code checks of the 'saferDev' package on a function. This includes strict checking of argument values, explicit package namespace qualification of all the called functions and explicit writing of all their arguments, among other things.
URL: <https://github.com/safer-r/saferMake>, <https://safer-r.github.io/saferMake/>
License: GPL-3
